What Are Dual Bridge Load Cells?
Dual bridge load cells represent the next generation of force measurement technology, utilizing MEMS-based designs with dual-bridge complementary structures to achieve exceptional accuracy. These sensors deliver measurement precision up to 0.01 grade while overcoming traditional limitations like temperature drift and vibration interference. Their unique architecture provides redundant measurement paths, ensuring reliability even if one bridge circuit fails - a critical advantage for safety-sensitive applications ranging from aircraft testing to pharmaceutical production lines.

